<script id="LoveStoryData" type="application/json">
[{"id":0,"number":"01","chapterLabel":"Story 01 of 29","title":"1. The Girl Who Was Afraid to Love Again","theme":"safe-place","atmosphere":"vulnerable","content":"Pyaar se mujhe kabhi nafrat nahi thi,\nbas pyaar par bharosa karne se darr lagta tha.\n\nShayad isliye nahi ki koi mujhe chhod dega,\nbalki isliye ki agar maine kisi ko\nsach mein apna maan liya,\ntoh uske jaane ke baad\nmain khud ko kaise sambhalungi?\n\nMain bachpan se hi strong rehna seekh gayi thi.\n\nApni problems khud solve karna,\nkhud ke decisions lena,\ngirna aur phir khud hi uth jaana.\n\nMaine kabhi kisi ke saamne\napni zarurat ko apni weakness nahi banne diya.\n\nIsliye dil ke aas-paas\nek invisible wall bana li thi.\n\nLog aaye,\nbaatein hui,\nkuch rishte bane bhi…\n\nLekin dil ne kabhi kisi ko\npoori tarah andar nahi aane diya.\n\nPhir tum aaye.\n\nAur pata nahi tumne aisa kya kiya\nki mujhe apni woh wall\nthodi kamzor lagne lagi.\n\nTumhare saath baat karna\ncomfortable lagne laga.\n\nTumhare saath apni baatein share karna\nnatural lagne laga.\n\nAur phir ek din realise hua\nki main tumse sirf baat nahi karti…\n\n**main tumhe apni life ka hissa samajhne lagi hoon.**\n\nMujhe nahi pata\nkab tum par trust hua.\n\nKab tumhari fikr hone lagi.\n\nKab tumhari khushi\nmeri khushi ban gayi.\n\nBas itna pata hai\nki jis ladki ko pyaar se darr lagta tha,\n\nusi ladki ne ek din\ntumhe apne dil mein jagah de di.\n\nAaj bhi darr lagta hai.\n\nLekin ab darr ke saath\nek ajeeb sa sukoon bhi hai.\n\nKyunki pehli baar\nmujhe laga hai—\n\nshayad har pyaar\ndard dene ke liye nahi aata.\n\nKuch log\nzindagi mein isliye aate hain\ntaaki hum dobara yakeen kar sakein\nki pyaar khoobsurat bhi ho sakta hai.\n\n**Aur tum mere liye wahi pyaar ho.**"},{"id":1,"number":"02","chapterLabel":"Story 02 of 29","title":"2. Before You, I Was Enough Alone","theme":"starlit","atmosphere":"independent","content":"Tumse pehle bhi\nmeri ek poori duniya thi.\n\nMere dreams the,\nmeri responsibilities thi,\nmeri priorities thi.\n\nMain apne decisions khud leti thi.\n\nMujhe kisi ke sahare ki aadat nahi thi.\n\nAkele jaana ho toh chali jaati thi.\n\nKoi problem ho toh\nsolution khud dhoond leti thi.\n\nMujhe laga tha\nzindagi isi tarah theek hai.\n\nPhir tum aaye.\n\nAur tumne meri life ko\ncomplete nahi kiya…\n\nKyunki main pehle se complete thi.\n\nTumne bas meri complete duniya mein\nek khoobsurat sa hissa add kiya.\n\nTumne mujhe dependent nahi banaya.\n\nTumne bas mujhe yeh realise karaya\nki independent hone ka matlab\nye nahi hota ki hum kisi ko apni life mein\njagah hi na dein.\n\nAb bhi main apne decisions le sakti hoon.\n\nApne dreams follow kar sakti hoon.\n\nApni responsibilities sambhal sakti hoon.\n\nBas difference itna hai—\n\n**ab har achievement ke baad\nsabse pehle tumhe batane ka mann karta hai.**\n\nHar achhi news mein\ntumhara naam yaad aata hai.\n\nHar difficult day mein\ntumhari awaaz sunne ka mann karta hai.\n\nMain tumhare bina\njeena nahi seekh rahi…\n\nMain tumhare saath\nzindagi ko aur khoobsurat banana seekh rahi hoon."},{"id":2,"number":"03","chapterLabel":"Story 03 of 29","title":"3. The First Time I Noticed You","theme":"glowing-heart","atmosphere":"spark","content":"Mujhe yaad nahi\nexactly kab tum mere liye\nbaaki logon se alag ho gaye.\n\nKoi ek dramatic moment nahi tha.\n\nKoi filmy background music nahi tha.\n\nBas chhoti-chhoti cheezein thi.\n\nTumhari baatein thodi zyada yaad rehne lagi.\n\nTumhari presence thodi zyada notice hone lagi.\n\nTumhare message ka wait\nthoda zyada hone laga.\n\nAur jab tum saamne hote the\ntoh pata nahi kyun\nmera attention automatically tumhari taraf chala jaata tha.\n\nShayad tab main khud bhi\nnahi samajh paayi thi\nki mere andar kuch badal raha hai.\n\nPyaar shayad kabhi\nekdum se nahi hota.\n\nWoh dheere-dheere\nhamari daily life mein ghul jaata hai.\n\nPehle kisi ki baat achhi lagti hai.\n\nPhir uski presence.\n\nPhir uski absence feel hone lagti hai.\n\nAur ek din samajh aata hai—\n\n**“Oh… mujhe is insaan ki aadat ho gayi hai.”**\n\nAur tumhari aadat\nkab pyaar ban gayi,\n\nmujhe aaj bhi nahi pata."},{"id":3,"number":"04","chapterLabel":"Story 04 of 29","title":"4. When You Became My Safe Place","theme":"safe-place","atmosphere":"sanctuary","content":"Duniya ke saamne\nmain kitni bhi strong rahun,\n\ntumhare saamne\nmujhe strong banne ki zarurat mehsoos nahi hoti.\n\nTumhare saamne\nmain apne emotions hide nahi karna chahti.\n\nAgar main sad hoon\ntoh sad reh sakti hoon.\n\nAgar mujhe rona hai\ntoh ro sakti hoon.\n\nAgar mujhe kisi baat ki complaint hai\ntoh bina soche keh sakti hoon.\n\nAgar mujhe kuch nahi kehna\ntoh tumhare saath chup bhi reh sakti hoon.\n\nAur shayad isi wajah se\ntum mere liye sirf pyaar nahi ho.\n\nTum mere liye\n**safe place ho.**\n\nEk aisi jagah\njahan mujhe perfect hone ki zarurat nahi.\n\nJahan mujhe apni feelings explain karne ke liye\nhar baar perfect words nahi dhoondhne padte.\n\nJahan main bas main ho sakti hoon.\n\nAur sach kahun,\n\npoori duniya mein\nek aisi jagah mil jaana\njahan hum apne real version ke saath\ncomfortable ho sakein…\n\n**shayad usse bada sukoon aur kuch nahi.**"},{"id":4,"number":"05","chapterLabel":"Story 05 of 29","title":"5. The Things I Never Said","theme":"letter-paper","atmosphere":"unspoken","content":"Tumhe pata bhi nahi\nmaine tumse kitni baatein kabhi kahi hi nahi.\n\nKitni baar tumhari ek chhoti si care\nmere dil ko touch kar gayi.\n\nKitni baar tumhari ek normal si baat\nmere liye poore din ki happiness ban gayi.\n\nKitni baar tumhari yaad aayi\naur maine bas phone dekha.\n\nMessage likha.\n\nPhir delete kar diya.\n\nKyunki kabhi-kabhi\ndil bahut kuch kehna chahta hai\npar words nahi milte.\n\nMaine tumhe kabhi nahi bataya\nki tumhari kaunsi chhoti si habit\nmujhe sabse zyada pasand hai.\n\nKab tumhari awaaz sunne ka mann karta hai.\n\nKab tumhari fikr hoti hai.\n\nKab main tumhe miss karti hoon\nlekin keh nahi paati.\n\nShayad tum kabhi samajh hi nahi paoge\nki pyaar sirf woh nahi hota\njo hum bol dete hain.\n\nPyaar woh bhi hota hai\njo hum chup rehkar mehsoos karte hain.\n\n**Aur meri khamoshi mein\ntumhare liye bahut saara pyaar chhupa hai.**"},{"id":5,"number":"06","chapterLabel":"Story 06 of 29","title":"6. When I Started Looking for You in Every Crowd","theme":"starlit","atmosphere":"searching","content":"Pehle kisi crowd mein\nmeri aankhein sirf apna raasta dhoondhti thi.\n\nPhir pata nahi kab\nwoh tumhe dhoondhne lagi.\n\nKahin tum aa jao.\n\nKahin tum nazar aa jao.\n\nKahin door se tumhari ek jhalak mil jaaye.\n\nAur jab tum mil jaate the\ntoh pata nahi kyun\npoori bheed ke beech bhi\nmujhe sirf tum nazar aate the.\n\nTab shayad main ise\nnormal samajhti thi.\n\nAaj samajhti hoon—\n\n**meri aankhein tumhe nahi,\nmera dil apna insaan dhoondh raha tha.**"},{"id":6,"number":"07","chapterLabel":"Story 07 of 29","title":"7. The Little Things That Made Me Fall","theme":"glowing-heart","atmosphere":"sweet","content":"Mujhe tumse pyaar\nkisi ek badi wajah se nahi hua.\n\nMujhe tumhari chhoti-chhoti cheezein\npasand aati gayi.\n\nTumhara care karna.\n\nMeri baat yaad rakhna.\n\nMeri silence notice karna.\n\nMera mood samajhna.\n\nMeri छोटी si problem ko bhi\nimportant samajhna.\n\nTumhara bina kahe\n“main hoon” keh dena.\n\nAur shayad mujhe isi cheez ne\ntumhare kareeb laaya.\n\nPyaar mein\nbadi gestures achhe lagte hain,\n\nlekin asli pyaar\naksar chhoti cheezon mein chhupa hota hai.\n\nEk “khana kha liya?”\n\nEk “ghar pahunch gayi?”\n\nEk “thak gayi ho?”\n\nEk “sab theek hai?”\n\nYe words simple hain.\n\nLekin jab ye tumhare hote hain,\n\n**toh mere liye\nye love letters ban jaate hain.**"},{"id":7,"number":"08","chapterLabel":"Story 08 of 29","title":"8. I Didn't Realise When You Became My Person","theme":"safe-place","atmosphere":"belonging","content":"Mujhe yaad nahi\nkab tum “tum” se\n“mere” ho gaye.\n\nKab tumhari problems\nmeri problems lagne lagi.\n\nKab tumhari happiness\nmeri happiness ban gayi.\n\nKab mujhe koi achhi news milti\ntoh sabse pehle tumhe batane ka mann karta.\n\nKab koi difficult day hota\ntoh tumhari awaaz sunne ka mann karta.\n\nBas ek din realise hua—\n\nTum meri life ka\nsirf ek hissa nahi rahe.\n\nTum woh person ban gaye\njiske saath main har important cheez\nshare karna chahti hoon.\n\nAur shayad “my person” ka matlab bhi yahi hai.\n\nWoh insaan\njiske saath good news bhi share karni ho,\n\naur woh bad day bhi\njiske baare mein kisi aur ko nahi batana.\n\n**Tum mere liye wahi person ho.**"},{"id":8,"number":"09","chapterLabel":"Story 09 of 29","title":"9. The Comfort of Your Name","theme":"letter-paper","atmosphere":"comfort","content":"Tumhara naam\nmere liye sirf ek naam nahi hai.\n\nPhone screen par tumhara naam aata hai\ntoh mood automatically change ho jaata hai.\n\nTumhara call aata hai\ntoh chahe din kitna bhi difficult ho,\n\nek second ke liye\nsab kuch pause ho jaata hai.\n\nTumhari awaaz mein\npata nahi kya hai.\n\nEk familiarity.\n\nEk comfort.\n\nEk sukoon.\n\nJaise duniya ke shor ke beech\nachanak koi apni awaaz suna de.\n\nAur mujhe realise hota hai—\n\n**“Haan, main akeli nahi hoon.”**\n\nShayad tumhe kabhi pata nahi chalega\nki tumhara naam\nmere liye kitna emotional hai."},{"id":9,"number":"10","chapterLabel":"Story 10 of 29","title":"10. The Love That Didn't Need Permission","theme":"starlit","atmosphere":"destiny","content":"Humne pyaar karne ka plan nahi banaya tha.\n\nNa koi perfect timing thi.\n\nNa koi perfect situation.\n\nBas dheere-dheere\ndo log ek doosre ke kareeb aate gaye.\n\nAur phir ek din\ndil ne decide kar liya.\n\nCircumstances kuch bhi kahe,\n\nresponsibilities kuch bhi ho,\n\nfuture kitna bhi uncertain ho…\n\nDil ne tumhe choose kar liya.\n\nPyaar ko permission ki zarurat nahi hoti.\n\nWoh bas ho jaata hai.\n\nAur jab hota hai,\n\ntoh hum chahe jitna samjhaayein\nki “ye complicated hai”…\n\nDil bas ek hi baat kehta hai—\n\n**“Par ye wahi insaan hai.”**"},{"id":10,"number":"11","chapterLabel":"Story 11 of 29","title":"11. The First Time I Held Your Hand","theme":"glowing-heart","atmosphere":"touch","content":"Kisi ka haath pakadna\nsimple lagta hai.\n\nLekin jab woh haath\nkisi aise insaan ka ho\njiske saath dil jud chuka ho,\n\ntoh woh moment simple nahi rehta.\n\nUsmein trust hota hai.\n\nCare hoti hai.\n\nEk silent promise hota hai.\n\nTumhara haath mere haath mein tha\naur mujhe laga—\n\nshayad ab mujhe har raasta\nakele nahi chalna padega.\n\nMujhe nahi pata\nfuture mein kitne difficult roads aayenge.\n\nKitni baar hum confuse honge.\n\nKitni baar hum thakenge.\n\nLekin uss moment mein\nbas ek hi thought tha—\n\n**“Agar tumhara haath mere haath mein rahe,\ntoh main chal lungi.”**"},{"id":11,"number":"12","chapterLabel":"Story 12 of 29","title":"12. The Places That Belong to Us","theme":"safe-place","atmosphere":"nostalgia","content":"Kuch jagahen\nmap par hoti hain.\n\nAur kuch jagahen\ndil mein.\n\nHamari woh jagah\nmere liye bas ek location nahi hai.\n\nWahan humne waqt bitaya.\n\nKabhi baat ki.\n\nKabhi hase.\n\nKabhi bas chup baithe.\n\nAur shayad isi liye\naaj bhi uss jagah ka naam\nmere andar kuch feel karata hai.\n\nAgar main kabhi wahan akeli jaaun,\n\ntoh shayad mujhe sab kuch same dikhega.\n\nWahi jagah.\n\nWahi hawa.\n\nWahi surroundings.\n\nBas tum nahi hoge.\n\nAur tab samajh aayega—\n\n**kisi jagah ko yaadgaar\njagah nahi banati.\n\nWahan bitaya hua waqt\naur saath rehne wala insaan\nuse yaadgaar banata hai.**"},{"id":12,"number":"13","chapterLabel":"Story 13 of 29","title":"13. Our Silences Had Conversations","theme":"letter-paper","atmosphere":"quietude","content":"Humari khamoshi\nkabhi empty nahi thi.\n\nUsmein bhi bahut kuch kaha jaata tha.\n\nTumhari ek nazar.\n\nMeri ek smile.\n\nTumhara paas baithna.\n\nMera bina kuch kahe\ntumhare kareeb rehna.\n\nKabhi hum dono ke paas\nkuch kehne ko nahi hota tha.\n\nPhir bhi uthne ka mann nahi karta tha.\n\nKyunki tumhare saath\nsilence awkward nahi thi.\n\n**Woh comfortable thi.**\n\nDuniya mein bahut log hain\njinse hum ghanton baat kar sakte hain.\n\nLekin bahut kam log hote hain\njin ke saath ghanton chup rehkar bhi\ndil peaceful feel karta hai.\n\nTum mere liye\nwoh insaan ho."},{"id":13,"number":"14","chapterLabel":"Story 14 of 29","title":"14. The Second Hug — When We Became Us","theme":"glowing-heart","atmosphere":"togetherness","content":"Pehla hug\nmere pyaar ka pehla izhaar tha.\n\nLekin doosra hug…\n\nWoh kuch aur tha.\n\nHum dono mile\naur dono ke dil mein\npyaar poora tha.\n\nBas lafz nahi the.\n\nThoda awkwardness tha.\n\nThodi nervousness thi.\n\nDono jaante the\nki kuch kehna hai.\n\nLekin shayad kisi mein\npehle bolne ki himmat nahi thi.\n\nAur phir…\n\nHumne ek doosre ko gale lagaya.\n\nNa koi question.\n\nNa koi answer.\n\nNa koi explanation.\n\nBas ek long silence.\n\nAur uss silence mein\nhamari dhadkanein\nhumse zyada loudly bol rahi thi.\n\n**“We are in love.”**\n\nUss moment mein\n“main” aur “tum”\npehli baar thoda peeche ho gaye.\n\nAur “hum”\npehli baar saamne aa gaya.\n\nWoh hug\nhamare relationship ka\nsirf ek moment nahi tha.\n\n**Woh hum banne ka pehla kadam tha.**"},{"id":14,"number":"15","chapterLabel":"Story 15 of 29","title":"15. The Day Our Hearts Said It First","theme":"letter-paper","atmosphere":"confession","content":"Humne ek doosre se\nbaad mein kaha—\n\n“I love you.”\n\nLekin hamare dil\nusse pehle hi jaan chuke the.\n\nWoh first hug.\n\nWoh second hug.\n\nWoh silences.\n\nWoh waiting.\n\nWoh missing each other.\n\nWoh care.\n\nSab kuch pehle hi\nconfess kar chuka tha.\n\nLafz bas uss sach ko\nawaaz dene aaye the.\n\nAur jab finally\nhumne ek doosre se keh diya—\n\n“I love you…”\n\nToh laga jaise\ndil bahut pehle se\nuss answer ka wait kar raha tha.\n\n**Kuch confessions lafzon se hote hain.\n\nAur kuch confessions\ndo dhadkano ke beech.**\n\nHamari love story\nshayad dono ka combination hai."},{"id":15,"number":"16","chapterLabel":"Story 16 of 29","title":"16. I Am Strong, But Not With You","theme":"safe-place","atmosphere":"tender","content":"Maine zindagi mein\nbahut baar strong banna seekha.\n\nHar situation handle ki.\n\nApno ki responsibilities uthayi.\n\nKhud rokar bhi\ndoosron ko smile di.\n\nLekin tumhare saamne\nmain strong nahi banna chahti.\n\nTumhare saamne\nmain woh ladki banna chahti hoon\njo kabhi-kabhi thak jaati hai.\n\nJo ro sakti hai.\n\nJo darr sakti hai.\n\nJo keh sakti hai—\n\n**“Aaj mujhe sambhal lo.”**\n\nKyunki mujhe pata hai\ntumhare saamne vulnerable hona\nunsafe nahi hai.\n\nTum mujhe weak nahi samjhoge.\n\nAur shayad isi liye\ntum mere liye\nsirf lover nahi,\n\n**mera emotional home ho.**"},{"id":16,"number":"17","chapterLabel":"Story 17 of 29","title":"17. Please Don't Mistake My Tears for Weakness","theme":"safe-place","atmosphere":"empathy","content":"Agar main chhoti si baat par\nemotional ho jaati hoon,\n\ntoh please mujhe weak mat samajhna.\n\nMaine bahut kuch handle kiya hai.\n\nBas har insaan ke andar\nek soft corner hota hai.\n\nMera bhi hai.\n\nAur tumhare saamne\nwoh soft corner\nhide karne ka mann nahi karta.\n\nMain chahti hoon\ntum mere aansuon ko samjho.\n\nUnhe stop karne ki jagah\nkabhi bas paas baith jao.\n\nMujhe advice dene ki jagah\nkabhi bas hug kar lo.\n\nKyunki kabhi-kabhi\nsolution nahi chahiye hota.\n\n**Bas kisi apne ka hona\nkaafi hota hai.**"},{"id":17,"number":"18","chapterLabel":"Story 18 of 29","title":"18. The Fear of Losing What I Finally Found","theme":"letter-paper","atmosphere":"devotion","content":"Tumhe paane ke baad\nmujhe ek naya fear mila hai—\n\ntumhe khone ka.\n\nPehle mujhe\nakele rehne se darr nahi lagta tha.\n\nAb lagta hai.\n\nKyunki ab mujhe pata hai\nkisi ka hona\nkitna beautiful hota hai.\n\nAb jab tum meri life ka part ho,\n\ntoh tumhare bina future imagine karna\nthoda scary lagta hai.\n\nMain tumhe possess nahi karna chahti.\n\nBas tumhe lose nahi karna chahti.\n\nDifference bahut bada hai.\n\nMain tumhari freedom bhi chahti hoon.\n\nTumhari happiness bhi.\n\nBas uss happiness mein\nkahin mera haath chhoot na jaaye…\n\n**ye darr rehta hai.**"},{"id":18,"number":"19","chapterLabel":"Story 19 of 29","title":"19. Sometimes I Just Need You","theme":"safe-place","atmosphere":"need","content":"Mujhe har baar\nsolution nahi chahiye.\n\nKabhi mujhe advice nahi chahiye.\n\nKabhi mujhe explanation nahi chahiye.\n\nKabhi mujhe bas tum chahiye.\n\nTumhara ek hug.\n\nTumhara haath.\n\nTumhari awaaz.\n\nTumhara woh simple sa—\n\n**“Main hoon.”**\n\nAur shayad uss ek sentence mein\nmere liye duniya bhar ka comfort hai.\n\nMain independent hoon.\n\nMain apni life handle kar sakti hoon.\n\nLekin iska matlab ye nahi\nki kabhi-kabhi mujhe tumhari zarurat nahi hogi.\n\n**Strong hone ka matlab\nye nahi ki humein kisi ki zarurat nahi.**"},{"id":19,"number":"20","chapterLabel":"Story 20 of 29","title":"20. When Distance Feels Bigger Than Miles","theme":"starlit","atmosphere":"longing","content":"Distance kilometres ka naam nahi.\n\nDistance tab feel hota hai\njab kisi apne ko\nhug karna ho\naur woh paas na ho.\n\nJab kuch achha ho\naur tumhare saath share karna ho\nlekin tum saamne na ho.\n\nJab din difficult ho\naur tumhari awaaz sunne ka mann kare\nlekin tum busy ho.\n\nMujhe future se darr nahi.\n\nMujhe sirf uss possibility se darr hai\nki responsibilities ke chalte\nhum physically door ho jaayein.\n\nKyunki main jaanti hoon—\n\n**door rehna possible hai,\npar tumse door feel karna\nmain nahi chahti.**"},{"id":20,"number":"21","chapterLabel":"Story 21 of 29","title":"21. Ek Taraf Zimmedari, Ek Taraf Tum","theme":"letter-paper","atmosphere":"resolve","content":"Ek taraf meri responsibilities hain.\n\nDusri taraf tum.\n\nEk taraf woh sapne\njo maine bachpan se dekhe hain.\n\nDusri taraf woh life\njo ab tumhare saath imagine karti hoon.\n\nAur main confused nahi hoon\nki mujhe kya chahiye.\n\nMujhe dono chahiye.\n\nMain apne dreams bhi poore karna chahti hoon.\n\nAur tumhare saath bhi rehna chahti hoon.\n\nBas kabhi-kabhi\ndarr lagta hai\nki life mujhe ek din\nchoose karne ke liye majboor na kar de.\n\nMain tumhe choose karungi…\n\nLekin main ye bhi chahti hoon\nki mujhe kabhi\ntum aur meri identity mein se\nek choose na karna pade.\n\n**Main tumhare saath\nkhud ko khona nahi,\nkhud ko aur paana chahti hoon.**"},{"id":21,"number":"22","chapterLabel":"Story 22 of 29","title":"22. I Don't Want to Choose Between My Dreams and You","theme":"starlit","atmosphere":"partnership","content":"Mujhe tumse pyaar karne ke liye\napne dreams chhodne ki zarurat nahi honi chahiye.\n\nAur apne dreams poore karne ke liye\ntumhe chhodne ki bhi nahi.\n\nMain career chahti hoon.\n\nGrowth chahti hoon.\n\nApni identity chahti hoon.\n\nAur tumhara saath bhi.\n\nMujhe aisi life chahiye\njahan main tumhari partner hoon,\n\nlekin sirf tumhari partner nahi.\n\nMain apni bhi identity hoon.\n\nMujhe tumhare saath\ngrow karna hai.\n\nTumhare peeche nahi chalna.\n\nTumse aage nahi bhaagna.\n\n**Tumhare saath chalna hai.**"},{"id":22,"number":"23","chapterLabel":"Story 23 of 29","title":"23. If I Have to Leave, Don't Let Me Feel Alone","theme":"safe-place","atmosphere":"promise","content":"Agar kabhi life mujhe\ntumse door le jaaye,\n\ntoh please\ndistance ko hamari story ka ending mat banana.\n\nAgar main kisi aur shehar mein hoon,\n\ntoh apni awaaz se mere paas rehna.\n\nAgar main busy hoon,\n\ntoh ek chhota sa message kar dena.\n\nAgar main thak jaaun,\n\ntoh mujhe yaad dilana\nki main akeli nahi hoon.\n\nMujhe physical distance se\nutna darr nahi.\n\nMujhe emotional distance se darr lagta hai.\n\nIsliye agar kabhi jaana pade,\n\n**toh mujhe jaane dena…\n\npar apne dil se kabhi door mat karna.**"},{"id":23,"number":"24","chapterLabel":"Story 24 of 29","title":"24. I Want a Life With You, Not Just a Love With You","theme":"glowing-heart","atmosphere":"future","content":"Mujhe sirf tumhare saath\nromantic moments nahi chahiye.\n\nMujhe ordinary life bhi chahiye.\n\nTumhare saath subah uthna.\n\nKabhi ek saath breakfast banana.\n\nKabhi tumhara kaam disturb karna.\n\nKabhi tumse bina reason ladna.\n\nPhir khud hi mana lena.\n\nWeekend par kahin jaana.\n\nKabhi ghar par hi rehna.\n\nKabhi paise ko lekar planning karna.\n\nKabhi future ko lekar tension lena.\n\nAur phir ek doosre ko dekhkar\nkeh dena—\n\n**“Chalo, milkar kar lenge.”**\n\nMujhe sirf love story nahi chahiye.\n\nMujhe **life story** chahiye.\n\nTumhare saath."},{"id":24,"number":"25","chapterLabel":"Story 25 of 29","title":"25. I Choose You, Again and Again","theme":"letter-paper","atmosphere":"commitment","content":"Agar mujhe\nsame beginning se\nsab kuch dobara choose karna pade,\n\ntoh main tumhe\ndobara choose karungi.\n\nPehli conversation.\n\nPehla comfort.\n\nPehla hug.\n\nPehli awkwardness.\n\nPehla confession.\n\nSab kuch.\n\nMain sirf easy days mein\ntumhe choose nahi karungi.\n\nDifficult days mein bhi.\n\nJab hum agree karein\ntab bhi.\n\nJab hum argue karein\ntab bhi.\n\nJab life beautiful ho\ntab bhi.\n\nJab life difficult ho\ntab bhi.\n\nKyunki tumhe choose karna\nmere liye sirf ek romantic decision nahi.\n\n**Ye woh decision hai\njo mera dil baar-baar\nkhud leta hai.**"},{"id":25,"number":"26","chapterLabel":"Story 26 of 29","title":"26. My Favourite Future Has You in It","theme":"starlit","atmosphere":"dream","content":"Main future ko\nperfect imagine nahi karti.\n\nMujhe nahi pata\nhum kahan rahenge.\n\nKya karenge.\n\nKitni problems hongi.\n\nKitni responsibilities hongi.\n\nLekin ek cheez\nmain imagine karti hoon—\n\n**tum.**\n\nMujhe luxury nahi chahiye.\n\nMujhe bas ek aisa ghar chahiye\njahan tum ho.\n\nJahan hum dono\napni busy life ke beech\nraat ko thoda waqt nikaal kar\nek doosre se poochein—\n\n“Din kaisa tha?”\n\nJahan fights bhi ho,\n\naur unke baad reconciliation bhi.\n\nJahan celebrations bhi ho,\n\naur difficult days bhi.\n\nMujhe perfect future nahi chahiye.\n\n**Mera favourite future wahi hai\njisme tum ho.**"},{"id":26,"number":"27","chapterLabel":"Story 27 of 29","title":"27. Wherever Life Takes Me, Let It Take Me to You","theme":"safe-place","atmosphere":"home","content":"Zindagi mujhe\nkahin bhi le jaaye.\n\nKoi bhi city.\n\nKoi bhi house.\n\nKoi bhi responsibility.\n\nKoi bhi phase.\n\nBas ek cheez same rehni chahiye—\n\n**tum.**\n\nMain apni life badalte hue dekh sakti hoon.\n\nCareer badal sakta hai.\n\nAddress badal sakta hai.\n\nResponsibilities badal sakti hain.\n\nHum dono badal sakte hain.\n\nLekin main chahti hoon\nki har version of me\ntumhe apna hi samjhe.\n\nKyunki mere liye\nhome koi address nahi.\n\nHome koi room nahi.\n\nHome koi city nahi.\n\n**Home woh feeling hai\njo tumhare paas rehkar milti hai.**"},{"id":27,"number":"28","chapterLabel":"Story 28 of 29","title":"28. This Is Not Goodbye","theme":"cinematic","atmosphere":"eternity","content":"Agar ye 27 poems\nhamari kahani ke\nalag-alag chapters the,\n\ntoh ye aakhri poem\nkhatma nahi hai.\n\nYe beginning hai.\n\nAbhi toh bahut kuch baaki hai.\n\nBahut saare hugs.\n\nBahut saare “I love you”.\n\nBahut saare random plans.\n\nBahut saari late-night conversations.\n\nBahut saari fights.\n\nBahut saari baar\nek doosre ko manana.\n\nBahut saare safar.\n\nBahut saari photos.\n\nBahut saari memories.\n\nAur shayad ek din\nbahut saalon baad\nhum dono ek saath baithkar\nin sab ko yaad karenge.\n\nTab shayad main tumse kahungi—\n\n“Yaad hai?\n\nEk ladki thi\njise kisi ko gale lagane mein bhi darr lagta tha.\n\nAur phir uss ladki ne\ntumhe gale lagakar\napna poora dil de diya.”\n\nAur tum shayad muskuraoge.\n\nMain bhi muskuraungi.\n\nKyunki tab humein pata hoga—\n\nWoh pehla hug\nsirf ek hug nahi tha.\n\nWoh pehla confession tha.\n\nWoh second hug\nsirf ek hug nahi tha.\n\nWoh “hum” ki beginning thi.\n\nAur aaj ke ye words\nsirf poems nahi hain.\n\n**Ye meri zindagi ke woh pages hain\njinmein maine tumhe likha hai.**\n\nMujhe nahi pata\naage ki kahani kaisi hogi.\n\nEasy hogi ya difficult.\n\nKitne turns aayenge.\n\nKitni baar hum thakenge.\n\nKitni baar circumstances\nhumein test karenge.\n\nBas ek cheez pata hai—\n\nAgar har baar\nmujhe choose karna pada,\n\ntoh main tumhe choose karungi.\n\nAgar har baar\nmujhe tumhara haath pakadna pada,\n\ntoh main pakadungi.\n\nAgar har baar\nmujhe tumse kehna pada\nki main tumse pyaar karti hoon,\n\ntoh main kahungi.\n\nAur agar kabhi\nmere paas kehne ko words na ho,\n\ntoh shayad tumhe\nmera woh pehla hug yaad aa jaayega.\n\nKyunki uss hug mein\nmaine jo kaha tha,\n\nwoh aaj bhi wahi hai—\n\n**“Mujhe nahi pata zindagi mujhe kahan le jaayegi,\npar main chahti hoon\nki mere har raaste ka aakhri mod\ntum tak aaye.”**\n\n**I love you.**\n\nAaj bhi.\n\nKal bhi.\n\nAur un sab kalon mein bhi\njinhe humne abhi saath jeena baaki hai. ❤️"},{"id":28,"number":"29","chapterLabel":"Story 29 of 29","title":"29. Alfajo Main Kabhi Bayan Nahi Kar Payenge","theme":"cinematic","atmosphere":"eternal-love","content":"Alfajo main kabhi bayan nahi kar payenge ki aap hamare liye kya ho \nAur kabhi kosis karein v to jajwat hamare aankhon main bhar aate hai\n\nAap woh aadat hai jo hum har pal Lena chahte hain \nAap woh sukoon hai jise hum har pal mehsus karna chahte hai\n\n\nAapke aanese jindegi guljar ho gayi hai \nAapke hone se zindegi khusi se bhar gayi hai \n\nAapka paas hona jaise khushiyon ko samete rakhna \nAapko muskurate dekhna jaise dunia ki sari khushiyan mil jana\n\n\nAapko roote dekh jaise zindegi tham si jaati hai\nAur jab muskuraen dil ko sukoon de jati hai\n\nAap hamare aadat ban gaye the \nPar ab aap hamari jarurat ban gae hai\n\nAap ke hone se hum jeene ki khwais rakhte hai warna jee to pehle v rahethe\nPar ab aapke saath har pal jeena chahte hai \n\nRishta Jo ajnabiyon ka tha aaj woh iss kadar modd liya ki aap toh hamare Jaan ban gaye \nPata nahi kab aapse mohabbat ho gai aap toh hamare jeene ki wajah ban gaye\n\nZiddi hun sirf aapke pass hi aap hi ke liye \nBas iss bebak ehsaas ko zinda rakhne k liye \n\nWaqt k saath yeh ehsaas v badh rahi hai \nAb toh khamoshi v chilla k bolti hai janab aap ka har waqt sirf hamara hai\n\nAb bas ek hi khwais hai\nAapke haath pakad ke maut tak ka Safar chalna hai\n\nAb aisa lagta hai\nSabkuch to mil gaya hai aapke aane se ab rabse mange v kya \nBas har duan main sirf aapko hi mangi hai"}]
</script>
